  "instructions": [
    "combine yautia and yeast in a bowl, cover, and let sit for 30 minutes",
    "heat olive oil in a large pan over medium heat, add onion and garlic and cook for 5 minutes",
    "add fish stock, bouillon cube, ginger, salt, and black pepper to the pan, bring to a boil, then reduce heat to low and simmer for 20 minutes",
    "add grated cheddar cheese to the pan and stir until melted",
    "fluff pilaf with a fork, then top with chopped parsley and scallions",
    "transfer pilaf to a serving dish and serve hot",
    "Ensure poultry is cooked to an internal temperature of 74°C / 165°F (juices run clear, no pink remaining) before serving."
